photo_merge_advanced.projective = Perspective mu nneɛma a wɔde hyɛ baabi koro (rotation ka ho)
photo_merge_advanced.cylindrical = Panorama a ɛte sɛ cylinder
photo_merge_advanced.deghost = Yi mfonini a ɛda ade a ɛretu no akyi mmɔho abien no fi hɔ (fa mfonini a edi kan no yɛ nhwɛso)
photo_merge_advanced.focal = Focal tentene (px) / mfonini no trɛw (px)
photo_merge_advanced.masks = Focus a wɔaka abom no de mfonini fã mask a wubetumi asesa di dwuma. Paw mask wɔ Mfonini fã mu na fa paint siesie no.
photo_merge_advanced.no_match = Wonhuu ɔkwan pa a wɔde mfonini no bɛhyɛ baabi koro. Fa mfonini a ɛwɔ mu nsɛm a ɛda adi pefee, ɛkata wɔn ho so pii na sɛnea wɔhwɛ no nsakra pii di dwuma.
photo_merge_advanced.invalid = Mfonini a wofi ase anaa nhyehyɛe a wɔde ka bom no nyɛ papa.
